    companionDialogue: This is Station 2, the Cotton Gin! Click the button on the
      screen to watch how raw cotton is cleaned and prepared for spinning.
  - stationName: Station 3 - Spinning
    stationTransform: {fileID: 34753583}
    companionDialogue: "Welcome to Station 3! Now that the raw cotton has been carded
      and drawn into loose sliver strands, it\u2019s time for the real magic: spinning."
  - stationName: Station 4 - knitting
    stationTransform: {fileID: 1847477949}
    companionDialogue: 'We''ve made it to Station 4: Weaving and Knitting. Look at
      the display to see how yarn is transformed into eco-friendly textile fabrics.'
  - stationName: Station 5 - cut n sew
    stationTransform: {fileID: 1182068468}
    companionDialogue: 'Here is Station 5: Cutting and sewing. Click below to explore
      how digital pattern alignment and smart sewing systems minimize waste and maximize
      efficiency'
  - stationName: Station 6 - Digital Printing
    stationTransform: {fileID: 663952102}
    companionDialogue: 'Here is Station 6: Eco-Friendly Digital Printing. Click below
      to see how we apply vibrant colors using sustainable, low-water techniques!'
  - stationName: Station 7 - Screen Printing
    stationTransform: {fileID: 1555811844}
    companionDialogue: "Alright, welcome to Station 7! Here\u2019s where we bring
      the garment to life with artwork: Screen Printing."
  - stationName: Station 8 - Dyeing
    stationTransform: {fileID: 247677764}
    companionDialogue: Station 7! Time to add some vibrant color at the Dyeing station.
